  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Events - Global Children&apos;s Care Reform Campaign (ODA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Foreign Secretary has launched a global initiative to ensure every child has the right to a safe and loving family environment, progressively ending institutionalisation of children in care and ensuring that no child is left behind. This Programme provides seed funding underpinning the initial phases of this Campaign and will enable the scoping of a larger programme of work. The key outputs of this Programme include delivery of &#x2018;Monthly Moments&#x2019; - a regular drumbeat of events and announcements to raise awareness of the Campaign, the harms of institutionalised care, and the benefits of family care.</narrative>
  </description>
